ターにいけないことをされてると思い慌てて防犯ブザーを鳴らそうとしている感じの絵をお願いします。\n\nよろしくお願い致します。\n\n参考資料:http://chara.u-stella.co.jp/gallery/ccd-1184meaccd-1210mia%e3%80%90original%e3%80%91/\nhttp://chara.u-stella.co.jp/gallery/ccd-1184meaccd-1210mia/\n\n（参考資料のミアメアの2つの姿の内描きやすい方の姿で大丈夫です。）", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@asagiyumina/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2224633, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/16cd81c5/uploads/origins/29f16443-7f37-4ee4-9b36-b90d60a839a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f07490230e8de706f3041997ead5636", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/16cd81c5/uploads/origins/29f16443-7f37-4ee4-9b36-b90d60a839a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f07490230e8de706f3041997ead5636, https://si.imgix.net/16cd81c5/uploads/origins/29f16443-7f37-4ee4-9b36-b90d60a839a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6037a4930ec448ced2bc30d04202c79a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/16cd81c5/uploads/origins/29f16443-7f37-4ee4-9b36-b90d60a839a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24d5aa603a3fac220b20077a2c573178 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/16cd81c5/uploads/origins/29f16443-7f37-4ee4-9b36-b90d60a839a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b077828e811b79ea3bf84636e74c61e5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/16cd81c5/uploads/origins/29f16443-7f37-4ee4-9b36-b90d60a839a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b077828e811b79ea3bf84636e74c61e5, https://si.imgix.net/16cd81c5/uploads/origins/29f16443-7f37-4ee4-9b36-b90d60a839a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&b